{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38575","headline":"岐阳蒙相国对宅因抒怀投献 · 吴融","name":"岐阳蒙相国对宅因抒怀投献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风有危亭月有台，平津阁畔好裴回。\n虽非宋玉诛茅至，且学王家种竹来。\n已得静居从马歇，不堪行色被蝉催。\n故园兰菊三千里，旅梦方应校嬾回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}